  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Climate Resilient Urban Development in the City of Beira</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project provides technical assistance to the municipal government with planning and management tools. Additionally, it focuses on bringing the selected catalyst projects to life in partnership with experienced organizations specialized in urban interventions and climate resilience. This phase will also finalize the Chipangara neighborhood&apos;s Urban Detailed Plan (PP), incorporating an urban regeneration project to enhance the neighborhood&#x2019;s infrastructure and living conditions. The project will support local authority during the Detailed Plan approval process and cadastral cataloging update.</narrative>
  </description>
